{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-3458953","kind":"blog","title":"【日记】2016年替身可达鸭签名会","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-05-14","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · みがわりな控室","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-3458953/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一在宝可梦中心东京湾举行签名会，后台还准备了替身可达鸭主题的可爱周边。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ポケモンセンター"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · みがわりな控室","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3458953.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160517101355id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3458953.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<br>\n今天\n\n增田的签名会\n\n在宝可梦中心东京湾\n\n举行啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今天也是\n\n“替身”主题商品的\n\n发售日……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/001-659570d1cb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/001-659570d1cb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"904\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n超级超级可爱！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n后台里\n\n宝可梦中心东京湾的\n\n工作人员们\n\n为我准备了\n\n非常棒的布置！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/002-fc7a7c8123.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/002-fc7a7c8123.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1054\" height=\"853\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n替身可达鸭拼图\n\n背面还有工作人员的留言！\n\n<br>\n\n替身可达鸭随行杯！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/003-919ccd1a6d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/003-919ccd1a6d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"882\" height=\"939\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n替身可达鸭\n\n好可爱！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n所以呢\n\n增田也换了身衣服（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/004-addc911a18.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/004-addc911a18.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"530\" height=\"776\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n宝可梦中心东京湾的\n\n工作人员们，谢谢你们！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>","markdown_ja":"<br>\n本日\n\nマスダのサイン会が\n\nポケモンセンタートウキョーベイで\n\n行われました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして今日は\n\n「みがわり」ものの\n\n発売日でもあり・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/001-659570d1cb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/001-659570d1cb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"904\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nむちゃむちゃかわいい！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n控室では\n\nポケモンセンタートウキョーベイの\n\nスタッフさんが\n\n素敵なセッティングを\n\nしてくれてました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/002-fc7a7c8123.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/002-fc7a7c8123.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1054\" height=\"853\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nみがわりコダックのパズル\n\n裏にスタッフさんのメッセージ！\n\n<br>\n\n\nみがわりコダックタンブラー！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/003-919ccd1a6d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/003-919ccd1a6d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"882\" height=\"939\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nみがわりコダック\n\nかわいい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nというわけで\n\nマスダも着替えました（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/004-addc911a18.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3458953/004-addc911a18.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"530\" height=\"776\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\nポケモンセンタートウキョーベイの\n\nスタッフのみなさんありがとう！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>"}}